OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANational security can't come at expense
OL,4,Aof social security, Burnham tells PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham says: "We do everything to
OL,7,Fsupport our national security, but it
OL,8,Fcan't come at the expense of social
OL,9,Fsecurity"
OL,11,FBadenoch replies: "It's unbelievable
OL,12,Fthat the prime minister would say
OL,13,Fthat... we need to fund our defence,
OL,14,Fnot spend all of our money on welfare"
OL,16,FYou can watch the exchange here - our
OL,17,Fcorrespondent Harry Farley says it was
OL,18,Fthe focus of the post-PMQs press
OL,19,Fbriefing with Burnham's team
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
