OL,3,AMiliband rejects chief rabbi's claim
OL,4,ABritish Jews in greater danger after
OL,5,Asanctions move
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband has
OL,8,Frejected the chief rabbi's warning that
OL,9,FBritish Jews are at greater risk after
OL,10,Fthe UK announced sanctions on Israeli
OL,11,Fsettlements in the occupied West Bank.
OL,13,FMiliband said that as a "proud British
OL,14,FJew" he disagreed with UK Chief Rabbi
OL,15,FSir Ephraim Mirvis, who described the
OL,16,Fmove as a "truly dark day" that would
OL,17,F"succeed only in bolstering the very
OL,18,Fextremism they seek to target".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
