OL,3,AHuge crowds in Norway as Prince William
OL,4,Ajoins European royalty at King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe funeral of King Harald V is taking
OL,8,Fplace in Norway's capital Oslo, with
OL,9,Fthe Prince of Wales and other European
OL,10,Froyals among attendees - watch live
OL,11,Fcoverage above
OL,13,FTens of thousands of people are lining
OL,14,Fthe streets to pay their respects after
OL,15,F13 days of national mourning
OL,17,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,18,F35 years on the throne - here's a mini
OL,19,Fprofile of the 89-year-old. His son,
OL,20,FHaakon VIII, has now succeeded him
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
