OL,3,AHuge crowds in Norway as Prince William
OL,4,Ajoins European royalty at King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing a service at Oslo Cathedral,
OL,8,Fthere's a flypast with four F-35
OL,9,Ffighter jets seen in a so-called
OL,10,Fmissing man formation
OL,12,FThe king's casket has travelled from
OL,13,Fthe cathedral to Akershus Fortress,
OL,14,Fwhere the monarch will be laid to rest
OL,16,FPrince William is representing King
OL,17,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,18,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,19,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
